        </video>
        <h2 class="subtitle has-text-centered">
          <span class="coolname">ASP</span> implements a language-conditioned robot policy using scene query tools. Queries support (i) open-vocabulary object grounding, (ii) spatial reasoning, and (iii) part-level interactions, 
          allowing LLM agents to achieve a wide range of tabletop and mobile manipulation behaviors.
        </h2>
      </div>
    </div>
